   "summary": "WASHINGTON —U.S. President Donald Trump said on Monday he is open to participating in a trilateral meeting with Chinese President Xi Jinping and Russian President Vladimir Putin and that it could be focused on denuclearization. \"We would have it to talk about nuclear weapons and denuclearization,\" Trump told reporters outside the White House.",
   "summary_zh": "华盛顿——美国总统唐纳德·特朗普周一表示，他对参加与中国国家主席习近平和俄罗斯总统弗拉基米尔·普京的三边会议持开放态度，该会议可能重点讨论无核化。“我们将讨论核武器和无核化，”特朗普在白宫外告诉记者。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "WASHINGTON —U.S. President Donald Trump said on Monday he is open to participating in a trilateral meeting with Chinese President Xi Jinping and Russian President Vladimir Putin and that it could be focused on denuclearization. \"We would have it to talk about nuclear weapons and denuclearization,\" Trump told reporters outside the White House. Earlier Monday, the Kremlin said that Putin, Trump and Xi could hold a three-way meeting on the sidelines of next month's APEC summit in China and that a potential meeting had come up in talks",
